Package: slobr
Title: An app to read and write files to SQLite databases
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Sebastian", "Dalgarno", , "seb@poissonconsulting.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3658-4517"))
Description: A package to run a Shiny app to read and write files to a
    SQLite database as flobs. A flob is a special type of BLOB type of
    BLOB that includes the file extension type.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/poissonconsulting/slobr
